From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JarvisNano <jarvisnano@local>
Date: Wed, 21 May 2026 21:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] partitions: grow emote 3M->6M (storage 4M->5M), reclaim unused
 ota_1

Hardware validation found emote_assets.bin = 3,395,435 B overflows the 3 MB
emote partition by ~244 KB once the 8 voice-face .eaf files are packed:
  E Expression_load: emote_mount_assets: ESP_ERR_INVALID_SIZE
→ the emote face renders BLANK (esptool flashes it anyway; it only checks total
flash, not logical partition fit). The native 466x466 mascot pack will need far
more, so this grows emote generously now.

The 16 MB layout had ota_1 (4 MB) allocated but NEVER flashed — OTA-B was
"reserved-but-empty" (see flasher_args.json: no ota_1; README memory map). We
reclaim that region: drop ota_1, move emote DOWN into 0x420000 and grow it to
6 MB, shift storage to 0xA20000 and grow it 4M->5M. Total still ends at
0xf20000 (unchanged top), 896 KB free for future skill assets. App stays in the
unchanged 4 MB ota_0 slot (app is ~2.5 MB).

OLD                                 NEW
 ota_0   0x020000 4M  app            ota_0   0x020000 4M  app   (unchanged)
 ota_1   0x420000 4M  (unused)       emote   0x420000 6M  ← grown, moved down
 emote   0x820000 3M                 storage 0xA20000 5M  ← grown, moved down
 storage 0xb20000 4M

Partitions are mounted by LABEL ("emote", "storage") in C, and flash.sh flashes
from build/flasher_args.json (regenerated from this CSV) — no hardcoded offsets
to chase in firmware. Only docs carried the old offsets (README + DISPLAY_UX_PLAN),
updated separately.

Reflash needs STORAGE=1 (storage moved + grew → FATFS must be re-laid-out). That
wipes the FATFS image; bootstrap's copy_firmware_assets repopulates Lua +
router_rules from the repo on next build, and Wi-Fi creds get re-provisioned.

This patch documents the native-tree mutation applied by scripts/bootstrap.sh
(apply_emote_partition_resize_patch), idempotent (guard: 0x600000 already in CSV).
---
diff --git a/application/edge_agent/partitions_16MB.csv b/application/edge_agent/partitions_16MB.csv
--- a/application/edge_agent/partitions_16MB.csv
+++ b/application/edge_agent/partitions_16MB.csv
@@ -1,8 +1,11 @@
 # Name,    Type, SubType, Offset,   Size
+# JarvisNano AMOLED-1.75: emote grown 3M->6M for native 466x466 art, storage
+# 4M->5M. ota_1 (4M, never flashed — OTA-B was reserved-but-empty) reclaimed.
+# Explicit offsets so the resized layout is unambiguous. Ends at 0xf20000 (same
+# top as before); 896K free at top for future skill assets.
 nvs,       data, nvs,     0x9000,   0x6000
 otadata,   data, ota,     0xF000,   0x2000
 phy_init,  data, phy,     0x11000,  0x1000
-ota_0,     app,  ota_0,         ,   4M
-ota_1,     app,  ota_1,         ,   4M
-emote,     data, spiffs,        ,   3M
-storage,   data, fat,           ,   4M
+ota_0,     app,  ota_0,   0x20000,  0x400000
+emote,     data, spiffs,  0x420000, 0x600000
+storage,   data, fat,     0xA20000, 0x500000

--- UPDATE 2026-06-10: second resize (applied by the same bootstrap.sh function) ---

emote grown again 6M -> 6.875M (0x6E0000) for higher-frame-count 466x466
reactive-face packs (rwave idle/listen/think/speak now 30/22/32/22 frames,
~3.71 MB, alongside ~3.40 MB of eye assets). The former 896K free top gap is
folded into emote; storage moves up to 0xB00000 (still 5 MB) and now ends
exactly at 0x1000000.

 OLD (this patch)                     NEW (2026-06-10)
  emote   0x420000 6M                  emote   0x420000 0x6E0000 (6.875M)
  storage 0xA20000 5M                  storage 0xB00000 5M (ends 0x1000000)

Same rules as before: partitions are mounted by LABEL, offsets flow from
flasher_args.json. Moving storage requires reflashing with STORAGE=1; Wi-Fi +
LLM config live in NVS (0x9000) and survive.
